  "description": "Gyeongseong, a city of desire and turmoil. Within it blooms a flower that never smiles: the courtesan Lee Seon. After ten years, she reunites with Han Seo-Jin, the man who took everything from her. Agonizing pain. Painful memories that resurface with every passing moment. The only way to end it is to take revenge on Han Seo-Jin. Fate turns to a curse, and flowers bloom upon hatred. They inflict wounds, indulge in passion, and fall together once more. In Gyeongseong, the city of tragic romance.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
